  "fixed": [
    "Bounded per-IP and global request counters replace unlimited client maps and per-request full-map scans",
    "HTTP nginx API rate/connection budgets reject excess before the Node broker; VPN stream routing unchanged",
    "Two outstanding uploads/jobs per IP; nine total; upload completes before taking the single converter slot",
    "MCP only exposes two read-only metadata tools; 16 KiB body, 5 second deadline, validated IDs/arguments and concurrency caps",
    "Overall deadline also closes stalled downloads; cancellation and rejection release slots and temporary files",
    "Converter output uses a 256 MiB / 10000 inode tmpfs Docker volume instead of a writable host output directory",
    "Docker init and independent 180-second container timeout; non-root, no network, read-only root, no capabilities",
    "Large downloads and multi-file ZIP output stream with backpressure, avoiding whole-result memory copies",
    "Directory/output traversal budgets and symlink/special-file rejection",
    "Conditional format catalogue handles nginx weak gzip ETags and returns 304",
    "Unhandled async request failures are caught; HTTP connection/header lifetimes bounded",
    "Backend release package now contains the required discovery, guard, stream and archive modules",
    "SSH password/keyboard-interactive authentication disabled; independent key login verified"
  ],
