  "remainingRisks": [
    "Public unauthenticated conversion can still have its finite queue exhausted by distributed clients. Limits bound resource use, not guaranteed availability.",
    "Direct shared website/VPN IP can be overwhelmed by link saturation or TLS/SYN floods before HTTP limits. Upstream provider anti-DDoS protection was not verified or enabled by this audit.",
    "HTTP broker still controls a rootful Docker daemon through the docker group. A broker compromise could affect the host; rootless/dedicated worker architecture remains a separate hardening step.",
